    <section id="faq">
        <div class="container px-5">
            <div class="row gx-5">
                <div class="col-md-12">
                    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

                    <div class="accordion mt-4" id="faqAccordion">

                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faqH1">
                                <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faqB1" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="faqB1">
                                    What is BeeYarn?
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="faqB1" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" aria-labelledby="faqH1" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                                <div class="accordion-body">BeeYarn is a social platform that connects people through real-time messaging, video calls, and discussion forums, enabling users to engage, express, and connect with like-minded individuals.</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faqH2">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faqB2" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faqB2">
                                    How can I create an account on BeeYarn?
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="faqB2" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="faqH2" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                                <div class="accordion-body">You can create an account by downloading the BeeYarn app from the <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.beeyarn.beeyarn" target="_blank">Google Play Store</a> (for Android users). Once downloaded, sign up using your email and basic information to start using BeeYarn!</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faqH3">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faqB3" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faqB3">
                                    Is BeeYarn free to use?
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="faqB3" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="faqH3" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                                <div class="accordion-body">Yes, BeeYarn is completely free to use for all users. There are no hidden fees or charges for accessing the platform's core features.</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faqH4">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faqB4" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faqB4">
                                    How do I post content on BeeYarn?
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="faqB4" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="faqH4" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                                <div class="accordion-body">Once logged in, you can post content directly from the app. You can share text, images, videos, and participate in discussions within various forums and groups available on the platform.</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faqH5">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faqB5" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faqB5">
                                    Can I delete my account?
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="faqB5" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="faqH5" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                                <div class="accordion-body">Yes, you can delete your account at any time. Go to your account settings in the BeeYarn app and you will find the option to deactivate or delete your account permanently.</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faqH6">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faqB6" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faqB6">
                                    How do I report inappropriate content?
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="faqB6" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="faqH6" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                                <div class="accordion-body">If you come across content that violates BeeYarn's community guidelines, click the "Report" button on the post or content. Our moderation team will review the report and take necessary action. See our <a href="contentpolicy">Content Policy</a> for a full list of what is prohibited.</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faqH7">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faqB7" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faqB7">
                                    Is my personal information safe on BeeYarn?
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="faqB7" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="faqH7" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                                <div class="accordion-body">Yes, we take your privacy seriously. We use encryption and other security measures to protect your personal information. Please review our <a href="privacy">Privacy Policy</a> for full details on how we handle your data. Our <a href="contentpolicy">Content Policy</a> also outlines the standards we hold all users and content to.</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faqH8">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faqB8" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faqB8">
                                    How can I contact BeeYarn support?
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="faqB8" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="faqH8" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                                <div class="accordion-body">You can reach our support team at <a href="mailto:support@beeyarn.com">support@beeyarn.com</a>.</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faqH9">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faqB9" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faqB9">
                                    What should I do if I forget my password?
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="faqB9" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="faqH9" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                                <div class="accordion-body">Click the "Forgot Password" link on the app's login screen. You will receive an email with instructions to reset your password.</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faqH10">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faqB10" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faqB10">
                                    Is there a web version of BeeYarn?
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="faqB10" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="faqH10" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                                <div class="accordion-body">BeeYarn is currently available on <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.beeyarn.beeyarn" target="_blank">Android</a>. iOS is coming soon.</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faqH11">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faqB11" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faqB11">
                                    What is the BeeYarn Creator Level System?
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="faqB11" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="faqH11" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                                <div class="accordion-body">The Creator Level System rewards your activity on BeeYarn with Yarn Points, which determine your creator level — a public badge displayed on your profile. Learn more on the <a href="beeyarn-creator-level-system.html">Creator Level System</a> page.</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faqH12">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faqB12" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faqB12">
                                    What is BeeYarn's refund policy?
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="faqB12" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="faqH12" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                                <div class="accordion-body">For information on refunds and eligible transactions, please review our <a href="refundpolicy">Refund Policy</a>.</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faqH13">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faqB13" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faqB13">
                                    How do I earn Yarn Points?
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="faqB13" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="faqH13" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                                <div class="accordion-body">You earn Yarn Points by being active on BeeYarn — posting, liking, commenting, sharing, going live, referring friends, and logging in daily. Points can be converted to cash once you meet the payout requirements. See the full breakdown on our <a href="yarnpoints">Yarn Points Policy</a> page.</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                    </div>

                    <p class="mt-4">Still have questions? Contact us at <a href="mailto:support@beeyarn.com">support@beeyarn.com</a>.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
